    db_request_port_evidence_authenticity_2026-08-25, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep2-20261127: demonstrated the gap live - fabricated a db-server-request-port bundle claiming real-loopback-wire-producer with all 7 acceptance counters PASS, no kernel I/O or wire transfer, signed via a scratch reviewer key, and the real admission path (check-external-must-check-receipt.shs:311-347) printed STATUS PASS. Root cause: admission verifies reviewer signature + producer-authored counters with nothing binding claims to a kernel-observed wire transfer; there is no pure-Simple request-port evidence module in src/lib (part of the gap; the v2 lane checker that would reject this is not wired into this gate). Fix (fail-closed, per the doc's no-synthetic-path rule): new src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/database/server/request_port_evidence.spl - verify_request_port_authenticity admits a record only when an independent kernel observation binds every counter to one owner (claimed server PID == claimed listener owner == kernel-observed socket owner, all > 0) and one secret (session digest == trace digest == sha256(wire), wire non-empty, kernel read/write byte counts == wire lengths) plus kernel accept/read/write triple, monotonic lifecycle, bounded stop; verdict enum Authentic / UnboundKernelObservation / UnboundLifecycle / OwnerBindingMismatch / KernelIoUnobserved / WireLengthMismatch / WireDigestMismatch / UnorderedLifecycle / StopOverBudget - any nil field fails closed. It selects no entry/protocol/producer (owner grant stands). Spec test/01_unit/lib/database/server/request_port_evidence_authenticity_spec.spl 11/11 PASS; neighbours credential_zeroization 7/7, storage_port 17/17, database 27/27 PASS; source_inventory.lock updated (+1). Residuals (pre-existing, owner-granted): the gate-test shell test fails at this tip (v1-era checker args - the producer/checker/gate-test incoherence the doc addendum records); the gate's canonical entry/fixture/v2 producer still must be authored by the DB-server owner, now against this binding primitive. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/lib/database/server/request_port_evidence_authenticity_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/lib/database/server/storage_port_spec.spl"

